            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7. In unusual circumstances such as the extended illness of a teacher or the evaluator the time limits specified below for completing or responding to an Observation Report(s) and an Assessment Report may be extended. This shall not be construed as extending the time for notice of non-reappointment.",
